.TH AUDIOCONVERT 1 "August 2026" "v1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
audioconvert \- Fast CLI Audio Converter, YouTube Downloader & Speech Transcriber
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B audioconvert
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] \fIFILE_OR_URL_OR_DIR\fR...
.br
.B audioconvert transcribe
\fIFILE_OR_URL\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B audioconvert
is a high-performance command-line utility for audio extraction, format conversion, online media downloading, and speech-to-text transcription.
It wraps \fBffmpeg\fR, \fByt-dlp\fR, and Speech Recognition engines with multi-core parallel worker support and automatic missing dependency installation (detecting package managers dnf, apt, pacman, zypper, or pip).
It supports processing unlimited/infinite files at once in a single invocation or recursively scanning entire folder trees.

.SH COMMANDS & OPTIONS
.TP
.BR transcribe " \fIFILE_OR_URL\fR"
Transcribe any local audio/video file or online streaming URL into text automatically.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-transcribe
Option flag equivalent for speech transcription.
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-format =\fIFMT\fR
Target audio format: \fBmp3\fR, \fBopus\fR, \fBm4a\fR, \fBwav\fR, \fBflac\fR, \fBaac\fR (Default: \fBmp3\fR).
.TP
.BR \-b ", " \-\-bitrate =\fIRATE\fR
Target audio bitrate, e.g., \fB128k\fR, \fB192k\fR, \fB320k\fR (Default: \fB192k\fR).
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-output =\fIPATH\fR
Output filename or target destination directory.
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-speed =\fIFACTOR\fR
Playback tempo multiplier (e.g., \fB1.5\fR for 1.5x speed audio).
.TP
.BR \-j ", " \-\-jobs =\fINUM\fR
Number of concurrent parallel worker tasks (Default: maximum system CPU cores, or pass \fB0\fR for max CPU cores).
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-recursive
Recursively scan directory for unlimited video and audio media files.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display help message and exit.

.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B audioconvert song.mp4
Convert song.mp4 to song.mp3 (192k bitrate).
.TP
.B audioconvert f1.mp4 f2.mp4 f3.mp4 f4.mp4 f5.mp4
Convert 5 files simultaneously using 5 parallel workers.
.TP
.B audioconvert transcribe voice.mp3
Transcribe voice recording audio to text.
.TP
.B audioconvert -f m4a -b 320k video.mkv
Extract high quality 320k m4a audio from video file.
.TP
.B audioconvert "https://youtu.be/..."
Download audio track from YouTube video directly to MP3.

